{"id":"enllacos-i-direccionaments","title":"Enllaços i direccionaments","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":1,"text":"Sin título","id":"sin-titulo"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":62,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-04-13-05-26","title":"Sesion_04_13.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":4}],"html":"<h1 id=\"sin-titulo\" class=\"note__h note__h--1\">Sin título</h1><h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Els enllaços permeten connectar pàgines entre si mitjançant l&#39;etiqueta <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> i l&#39;atribut <code>href</code>. Poden ser locals (al mateix lloc web), externs (a un altre web), ancores (a una zona de la mateixa pàgina) o de correu electrònic (<code>mailto</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;https://www.wikipedia.org&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Anar a Wikipedia<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 902]\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mailto:info@web.com&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Contactar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 911]\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;../index.html&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Tornar a l&#x27;inici<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 871]</code></pre></div>"}